<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🔑 Feature Summary</h3>
<div class="overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal"><thead class="text-left"><tr><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Feature</th><th scope="col" class="text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-border-300/60 py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Open any PDF</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ File browser built-in</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Adjustable font/zoom</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Slider (0.5× to 2.5×)</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Dark / Light mode</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Toggle on home screen</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Page navigation</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Prev / Next buttons</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Scroll within page</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ ScrollView</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">Samsung M12 compatible</td><td class="border-b-0.5 border-border-300/30 py-2 pr-4 align-top">✅ Android 21+</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">⚠️ Important Notes</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Highlighting</strong> text in a PDF requires touch-gesture detection — that's a Phase 2 feature we can add after the base app works</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>First build is slow</strong> — be patient, don't cancel it</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">If build fails, run <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">buildozer android clean</code> and try again</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Your Jupyter notebook <strong>cannot</strong> build Android APKs — use WSL terminal directly</li>
</ol>
