="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">apt</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">install</span><span> -y libgl1-mesa-dev libgles2-mesa-dev libffi-dev libssl-dev pkg-config libfreetype6-dev libportmidi-dev libsdl2-dev libsdl2-image-dev libsdl2-mixer-dev libsdl2-ttf-dev python3-dev</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
