<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Actually, the easiest way — just close nano and use a single command to edit everything at once!</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Press <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Ctrl+C</code> first to close search, then <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Ctrl+X</code> to exit nano. Then run these commands one by one:</p>
