="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">apt</span><span> remove -y cmake
</span></span><span><span>pip </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">install</span><span> </span><span class="token token assign-left" style="color: rgb(251, 173, 96);">cmake</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(234, 236, 240);">==</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">3.28</span><span>.4</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
