</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(251, 173, 96);">source</span><span> venv/bin/activate
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">docker</span><span> run --volume ~/pdf_reader:/home/user/hostcwd kivy/buildozer android debug</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>However</strong>, given all these issues with WSL + Docker, I strongly recommend switching to <strong>GitHub Actions (Option B)</strong> — it's honestly much simpler for your setup:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Create a free GitHub account</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Upload your 2 files (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">main.py</code> and <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">buildozer.spec</code>)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">It builds the APK automatically in the cloud</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You download the APK file directly</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>No cmake issues, no NDK issues, no Docker issues — just works!</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Want me to guide you through the GitHub Actions approach? It'll take only 10 minutes and will definitely work. Your choice!</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
