</span></span><span><span>      </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">name</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span> Build APK
</span></span><span><span>        </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">uses</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span> ArtemSBulgakov/buildozer</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span>action@v1
</span></span><span><span>        </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">with</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>          </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">command</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span> buildozer android debug
</span></span><span><span>      </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">name</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span> Upload APK
</span></span><span><span>        </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">uses</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span> actions/upload</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span>artifact@v3
</span></span><span><span>        </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">with</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>          </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">name</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span> pdf</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span>reader</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span>apk
</span></span><span><span>          </span><span class="token token key" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">path</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">:</span><span> bin/</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(244, 123, 133); font-weight: bold;">*.apk</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 4 — Commit and Push</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Back in GitHub Desktop:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You'll see the files listed under <strong>Changes</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">first commit</code> in the Summary box</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Commit to main</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Push origin</strong></li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 5 — Download your APK</h3>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>github.com</strong> in browser</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Open your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-app</code> repository</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Actions</strong> tab</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Wait for the green checkmark (10-15 min)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click the run → scroll down → <strong>Artifacts</strong> → download <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-apk</code></li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Start with Step 1 and send a screenshot! 🚀</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
