<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Press Enter — you'll see your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">main.py</code> and <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">buildozer.spec</code> files there.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Select both files → Copy them (Ctrl+C)</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Then navigate to your new GitHub repo folder (e.g. <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">C:\Users\ADMIN\Documents\pdf-reader-app</code>) and <strong>paste them (Ctrl+V)</strong>.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Meanwhile, also create the workflow folder:</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">In the <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-app</code> folder:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Create a new folder called <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.github</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Inside it, create another folder called <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">workflows</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Inside <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">workflows</code>, create a new text file called <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">build.yml</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Open it with Notepad and paste the yaml code I gave you</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save it</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Send a screenshot of your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-app</code> folder once you have the files copied in! 📁</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
