</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">No worries! The <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">build.yml</code> file doesn't exist yet — we need to create it. Let me guide you simply:</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1 — Open your pdf-reader-app folder</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Click the <strong>GitHub</strong> folder → then open <strong>pdf-reader-app</strong></p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 2 — Create .github folder</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Inside <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-app</code>:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>New → Folder</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.github</code> and press Enter</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 3 — Create workflows folder</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Open the <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.github</code> folder → <strong>New → Folder</strong> → type <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">workflows</code></p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 4 — Create build.yml</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Open <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">workflows</code> folder → <strong>New → Text Document</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">When it asks for name, type:</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="Code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
