<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">(It will warn about changing extension — click <strong>Yes</strong>)</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 5 — Open build.yml with Notepad</h3>
