't need to repeat anything!</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">No, you don't need to repeat anything! You're done with the file creation.</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Now do these steps:</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 1 — Go to GitHub Desktop</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">You should see new files in the <strong>Changes</strong> tab (build.yml should appear)</p>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 2 — Commit</h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">add workflow</code> in the <strong>Summary</strong> box</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Commit to main</strong></li>
</ul>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 3 — Publish</h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Publish repository</strong> (top right blue button)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Uncheck <strong>"Keep this code private"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Publish Repository</strong></li>
</ul>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 4 — Watch it build</h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>github.com</strong> in your browser</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Find your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-app</code> repository</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click the <strong>Actions</strong> tab</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You'll see a workflow running with a yellow/orange spinner ⏳</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Wait 15–20 minutes for it to finish</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 5 — Download APK</h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click the completed workflow run</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Scroll down to <strong>Artifacts</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Download <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-apk</code></li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Go to GitHub Desktop now and send a screenshot of what you see in the Changes tab! 🚀</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
