rkflow" was pushed but the Actions page still shows only 2 runs.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">The "fix workflow" was pushed but the Actions page still shows only 2 runs. The new workflow file may not have saved correctly.</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Let's redo the build.yml file properly:</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 1 — Open build.yml in Notepad</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Go to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">pdf-reader-app\.github\workflows\build.yml</code> → right-click → Open with Notepad</p>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 2 — Select ALL and delete everything</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Press <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Ctrl+A</code> then <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Delete</code></p>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Step 3 — Paste this new content:</h4>
