nnect USB cable:</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">When you connect USB cable:</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">On your Samsung Galaxy M12:</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Pull down the notification bar</strong> (swipe down from top of screen)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You'll see a notification that says <strong>"USB charging this device"</strong> or <strong>"Android System - USB"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Tap on that notification</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">A menu appears with options:
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Charging only</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>File Transfer</strong> ← tap this one</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">PTP</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">MIDI</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Tap <strong>"File Transfer"</strong></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Then on your <strong>laptop</strong>, open File Explorer and you'll see your <strong>Galaxy M12</strong> appear in the left sidebar under "This PC".</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Open it → <strong>Internal storage → Download</strong> folder → paste the APK there.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Then on phone, open <strong>My Files app</strong> → Downloads → tap the APK → Install!</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">First download the APK from GitHub to your laptop — did you find the Artifacts section when you clicked the green run? Send a screenshot!</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
