2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Perfect! Just wait for the build to complete.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">While you wait, here's what your <strong>Book Reader</strong> app will look like when it's done:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Home screen</strong> — warm library with your books in a grid, each showing title and reading progress %</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Tap a book</strong> → opens right where you left off</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Reading screen</strong> — clean full screen, tap center to hide/show controls</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Bottom bar</strong> — prev/next page + zoom slider</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>3 themes</strong> — tap the moon/sun icon to switch Light ☀️ → Sepia 📜 → Dark 🌙</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Keep refreshing the Actions tab every few minutes. The build takes <strong>15–25 minutes</strong>.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">When it goes <strong>green ✅</strong> → click it → scroll down → download <strong>pdf-reader-apk</strong> zip → extract → transfer to phone via USB → install!</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Come back and send a screenshot when you see the result! 🚀📚</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
