<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">First — let's see the crash log</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">The crash is happening for a specific reason. Let's find out why.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>On your phone:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>Settings → Apps → Book Reader (or PDF Reader)</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Does it even show the app installed?</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Also tell me:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">When you tap the app, does it show a <strong>black screen</strong> then crash?</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Or does it crash <strong>immediately</strong> without showing anything?</li>
</ul>
